  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/upZiz61.png\" alt=\"煙囪\" width=\"240\" height=\"240\"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">新增<strong>磚塊、鵝卵石、石磚、泥磚、鐵、銅</strong>與<strong>陶土</strong>煙囪，會散發煙霧粒子。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/H4YUooO.png\" alt=\"功能特色\" width=\"1000\" height=\"774\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">「煙囪」已在 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Boodlyneck\" rel=\"nofollow\">Boodlyneck</a>&nbsp;(於 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ICobJ1QU598&t=293s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">4:52</a>) 的影片中介紹：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ICobJ1QU598?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&bull;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用 Fabric 1.20 或更低版本？這裡有移植版：</span>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sooty-chimneys-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sooty Chimneys for Fabric</a> 由&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/otomir23/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">otomir23</a>&nbsp;製作</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FzHKGDW2et\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/discord.png\" alt=\"Discord 伺服器\" width=\"550\" height=\"88\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">喜歡這個模組嗎？您的支持將讓我能夠繼續開發本模組及其他模組！</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"550\" height=\"108\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253d4VPMCBCLZVUEA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/paypal.png\" alt=\"PayPal\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">查看我的其他模組：</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exposure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/main.png\" alt=\"曝光\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/envelope\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/envelope/main.png\" alt=\"信封\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chalk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/L5IBBEH.png\" alt=\"粉筆\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wares\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tpmC8km.png\" alt=\"商品\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/monobank\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1Le5yWV.png\" alt=\"Monobank\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/thief/main.png\" alt=\"小偷\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/salt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NhbmXO8.png\" alt=\"鹽\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/scholar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/scholar/main-512.png\" alt=\"學者\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horseman\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/horseman/main.png\" alt=\"騎士\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>",
